# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# One animated sprite does it all: eight expressions at 2 fps (smile, grin,
# blink, glance left and right, surprise, wink) scaled 2x by `fit contain`.
# Two faces across the diagonal of a 64x64 design (`U 64 64`), the second
# run at 3 fps by the layer's `A` override so the two never pull the same face
# at once; the boxes scale with the panel (16 px faces on 32x32, 64 on 128).
S - Googly Face
U 64 64
L color 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Backdrop
K 101828
L sprite 0 0 32 32 normal 100 none contain 1
N Face
I @spr/face-moods
L sprite 32 32 32 32 normal 100 none contain 1
N Face 2
I @spr/face-moods
A 3
